msgid "Get the Code and Models"
msgstr "Code와 Model 준비"

msgid "SO-101 vial-to-rack task represented as a simulation scene."
msgstr "Simulation scene으로 표현한 SO-101 vial-to-rack task입니다."

msgid "What Do I Need for This Module?"
msgstr "이 Module에 필요한 준비물"

msgid ""
"Hands-on. You'll need Ubuntu Linux, Git with Git LFS, Docker, the CUDA Toolkit, the NVIDIA "
"Container Toolkit, and an NVIDIA RTX GPU."
msgstr ""
"실습입니다. Ubuntu Linux, Git LFS가 포함된 Git, Docker, CUDA Toolkit, NVIDIA Container Toolkit, NVIDIA RTX"
" GPU가 필요합니다."

msgid ""
"Install Git LFS on the host and initialize it before cloning so the robot assets and course media"
" download correctly:"
msgstr "Robot asset과 과정 media를 올바르게 내려받을 수 있도록, clone 전에 host에 Git LFS를 설치하고 초기화하세요."

msgid ""
"Build one workshop image for simulation, calibration, teleoperation, recording, GR00T training, "
"and evaluation."
msgstr "Simulation, calibration, teleoperation, recording, GR00T 학습과 평가에 사용할 하나의 workshop image를 build합니다."

msgid ""
"Tested on Ubuntu Linux newer than 22.04 with an NVIDIA RTX 6000 Pro (Blackwell), RTX 5090 "
"(Blackwell), or RTX 6000 (Ada) GPU. Install the host software before building the image."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Linux 22.04보다 최신 버전에서 NVIDIA RTX 6000 Pro (Blackwell), RTX 5090 (Blackwell), RTX 6000 "
"(Ada) GPU로 검증했습니다. Image를 build하기 전에 host software를 설치하세요."

msgid ""
"See [Computer Hardware Prerequisites](02-how-to-take-this-course.md#computer-hardware-"
"prerequisites)."
msgstr ""
"[Computer Hardware Prerequisites](02-how-to-take-this-course.md#computer-hardware-prerequisites)를"
" 확인하세요."

