msgid "Physics"
msgstr "Physics"

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "Newton with the MJWarp solver"
msgstr "Newton with the MJWarp solver"

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "Camera rendering"
msgstr "Camera rendering"

msgid "ovrtx; Isaac Lab supplies compatible ovrtx and OVStage versions"
msgstr "ovrtx. Isaac Lab에서 호환되는 ovrtx와 OVStage 버전을 제공합니다."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "LeRobot"
msgstr "LeRobot"

msgid "0.6.0 with training, GR00T, async inference, and visualization support"
msgstr "0.6.0. 학습, GR00T, async inference, visualization 지원 포함"

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "Policy"
msgstr "Policy"

msgid "GR00T 1.7, using `nvidia/GR00T-N1.7-3B` for post-training"
msgstr "GR00T 1.7. Post-training에 `nvidia/GR00T-N1.7-3B` 사용"

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "Container"
msgstr "Container"

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "CUDA 13, Ubuntu 24.04, Python 3.12"
msgstr "CUDA 13, Ubuntu 24.04, Python 3.12"

msgid ""
"The workshop runs without an Isaac Sim or Kit application. Build the pinned stack rather than "
"substituting a separate Isaac Sim installation."
msgstr "이 workshop은 Isaac Sim 또는 Kit application 없이 실행됩니다. 별도 Isaac Sim 설치로 대체하지 말고 고정된 stack을 build하세요."

msgid "Clone the Repository"
msgstr "Repository Clone"

msgid ""
"**Open a terminal on the host**, **clone** the repository into your home directory, and **enter**"
" its directory:"
msgstr "**Host에서 terminal을 열고**, home directory에 repository를 **clone**한 뒤 해당 directory로 **이동**합니다."

msgid "Build the Workshop Container"
msgstr "Workshop Container Build"

msgid ""
"**Build** the image and **create** the persistent output directories from the repository root on "
"the host:"
msgstr "Host의 repository root에서 image를 **build**하고 영구 output directory를 **생성**합니다."

msgid "The same image supports simulation and real-robot exercises."
msgstr "같은 image로 simulation과 실제 robot 실습을 모두 진행합니다."

msgid "Start the Workshop Container"
msgstr "Workshop Container 시작"

msgid "**Start** the container from the repository root on the host:"
msgstr "Host의 repository root에서 container를 **시작**합니다."

msgid ""
"The shell starts in `/workspace/Sim-to-Real-SO-101-Workshop`. Its shared Python environment, "
"`/workspace/IsaacLab/env_isaaclab`, is active automatically."
msgstr ""
"Shell은 `/workspace/Sim-to-Real-SO-101-Workshop`에서 시작하며, 공통 Python environment인 "
"`/workspace/IsaacLab/env_isaaclab`이 자동으로 활성화됩니다."

msgid ""
"**Keep** this terminal open and use the container prompt for the following lessons. Finish or "
"stop the current exercise with **Ctrl+C**, wait for shutdown to complete, then run the next "
"command at the same prompt. Closing this main shell stops the container."
msgstr ""
"이 terminal을 **열어 둔 채** 이후 실습을 container prompt에서 진행하세요. 현재 실습을 마치거나 **Ctrl+C**로 중단한 뒤 종료가 완료될 때까지"
" 기다리고, 같은 prompt에서 다음 명령을 실행합니다. Main shell을 닫으면 container도 종료됩니다."

msgid ""
"All later workshop commands run from `/workspace/Sim-to-Real-SO-101-Workshop` inside this "
"container unless a step explicitly says **host**. Settings in the mounted `docker/env` load when "
"the container shell starts. A plain `export` lasts for the current shell; use the course's "
"`setenv` helper for persistent robot ports and IDs."
msgstr ""
"단계에 **host**라고 명시되어 있지 않다면 이후 명령은 container 내부의 `/workspace/Sim-to-Real-SO-101-Workshop`에서 실행합니다."
" Mount된 `docker/env`의 설정은 container shell 시작 시 읽습니다. 일반 `export`는 현재 shell에만 적용됩니다. Robot port와 "
"ID를 유지하려면 과정의 `setenv` helper를 사용하세요."

msgid "Reconnect to a running container or open an optional extra shell"
msgstr "실행 중인 Container에 다시 접속하거나 추가 Shell 열기"

msgid "From a host terminal, check whether the container is running:"
msgstr "Host terminal에서 container가 실행 중인지 확인합니다."

msgid "If it is running and you need a shell, use:"
msgstr "실행 중인 container에 shell이 필요하면 다음을 사용합니다."

msgid ""
"If it has stopped, repeat step 3 from the repository root on the host. Mounted datasets, models, "
"outputs, and settings persist. Re-enter ordinary `export` variables when starting a new shell. An"
" extra shell is optional; simulation evaluation starts its server in the background of the same "
"terminal."
msgstr ""
"종료되어 있다면 host의 repository root에서 3단계를 다시 실행하세요. Mount된 dataset, model, output, 설정은 유지됩니다. 새 "
"shell에서는 일반 `export` 변수를 다시 설정해야 합니다. 추가 shell은 선택 사항이며, simulation 평가에서는 같은 terminal의 "
"background로 server를 시작합니다."

msgid "Persistent Files"
msgstr "유지되는 파일"

msgid "Show container mounts and persistent file locations"
msgstr "Container mount와 영구 파일 위치 보기"

msgid ""
"Edits under the mounted directories persist on the host. The `--rm` option removes the container "
"when its main process exits."
msgstr "Mount된 directory의 수정은 host에 유지됩니다. `--rm` 옵션은 main process가 끝나면 container를 제거합니다."

msgid "Check the Simulation"
msgstr "Simulation 확인"

msgid "Inside the container, **list** the tasks and **run** the physics-only check:"
msgstr "Container 안에서 task를 **조회**하고 physics-only 검사를 **실행**합니다."

msgid "**Stop** with **Ctrl+C**, then **run** the camera-rendering check:"
msgstr "**Ctrl+C**로 **종료**한 뒤 camera-rendering 검사를 **실행**합니다."

msgid ""
"The first ovrtx run can take a few minutes to warm up shader caches. The interactive camera "
"display is introduced in [Teleoperating in Sim](08-simulation-teleoperation.md)."
msgstr ""
"ovrtx를 처음 실행하면 shader cache 준비에 몇 분이 걸릴 수 있습니다. Interactive camera display는 [Teleoperating in "
"Sim](08-simulation-teleoperation.md)에서 다룹니다."

msgid ""
"Camera commands require explicit `--cameras` selection and `presets=newton,ovrtx_renderer`. "
"Physics-only commands use `--cameras none presets=newton`."
msgstr ""
"Camera 명령에는 명시적인 `--cameras` 선택과 `presets=newton,ovrtx_renderer`가 필요합니다. Physics-only 명령은 "
"`--cameras none presets=newton`을 사용합니다."

msgid "Choose the Task for Each Stage"
msgstr "단계별 Task 선택"

msgid "Show task IDs for collection and evaluation"
msgstr "수집 및 평가 Task ID 보기"

msgid ""
"**Leader-arm collection:** `Newton-So101-Teleop-Vials-To-Rack-v0`, or `Newton-So101-Teleop-Vials-"
"To-Rack-DR-v0` for domain randomization, with `lerobot_agent`."
msgstr ""
"**Leader-arm collection:** `lerobot_agent`에 `Newton-So101-Teleop-Vials-To-Rack-v0`를 사용합니다. Domain"
" Randomization에는 `Newton-So101-Teleop-Vials-To-Rack-DR-v0`를 사용합니다."

msgid ""
"**Scripted collection:** `Newton-So101-Auto-Vials-State-Machine-v0`, or `Newton-So101-Auto-Vials-"
"State-Machine-DR-v0`, with `vials_state_machine`. Follow [Automated Data Collection](08"
"-simulation-teleoperation.md#optional-automated-data-collection)."
msgstr ""
"**Scripted collection:** `vials_state_machine`에 `Newton-So101-Auto-Vials-State-Machine-v0` 또는 "
"`Newton-So101-Auto-Vials-State-Machine-DR-v0`를 사용합니다. [Automated Data Collection](08-simulation-"
"teleoperation.md#optional-automated-data-collection)을 따르세요."

msgid ""
"**Policy evaluation:** `Newton-So101-Teleop-Vials-To-Rack-Eval-v0`, or `Newton-So101-Teleop-"
"Vials-To-Rack-DR-Eval-v0`, with `lerobot_eval` and a LeRobot policy server."
msgstr ""
"**Policy evaluation:** `lerobot_eval`과 LeRobot policy server를 사용하며, task는 `Newton-So101-Teleop-"
"Vials-To-Rack-Eval-v0` 또는 `Newton-So101-Teleop-Vials-To-Rack-DR-Eval-v0`입니다."

msgid ""
"`list_envs` also lists the bare-arm, lightbox, and automatic-reach tasks. Use the vial-to-rack "
"task for the collection method you choose."
msgstr ""
"`list_envs`는 bare-arm, lightbox, automatic-reach task도 표시합니다. 선택한 수집 방식에 맞는 vial-to-rack task를 "
"사용하세요."

msgid "Get the Models"
msgstr "Model 준비"

msgid "**Stop** the camera check with **Ctrl+C**, then **authenticate** inside the container:"
msgstr "**Ctrl+C**로 camera 검사를 **종료**하고 container 안에서 **인증**합니다."

msgid ""
"**Use** [Datasets and Models](datasets-and-models.md) to select a compatible LeRobot GR00T 1.7 "
"checkpoint, or train one in [GR00T Post-Training](10-groot.md#reference-post-train-your-own-"
"model). Downloads belong under `models/`."
msgstr ""
"[Datasets and Models](datasets-and-models.md)에서 호환되는 LeRobot GR00T 1.7 checkpoint를 선택하거나 [GR00T "
"Post-Training](10-groot.md#reference-post-train-your-own-model)으로 직접 학습합니다. Download한 파일은 "
"`models/` 아래에 둡니다."

msgid "What's Next?"
msgstr "다음 단계"

msgid "Continue to [Calibrating the SO-101](07-calibrating-so101.md)."
msgstr "[Calibrating the SO-101](07-calibrating-so101.md)으로 이동하세요."

